            "block_content": "where  $ \\tau \\in \\mathbb{R} $ is an unknown, non-stochastic treatment-effect parameter we seek to estimate. Fix  $ \\alpha \\in (0,1) $, and assume that, for every  $ t $ and every  $ u \\geq 0 $,",
